Rule 26 (tuple of ints used as kernel size must have length 2)
{v_1 : tuple(int)} |= v_1.len = 2 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 1] : v_1[i] > 0

Rule 19 (compatibility of integer or float (data) type tensor and variable)
{v1 : tensor, v2 : int ⊎ float} |= if 1 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 5 then 1 ≤ v2 ∧ v2 ≤ 5 else if 6 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 8 then 1 ≤ v2 ∧ v2 ≤ 8 else false

